# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include the source directories by name. Podman/buildah does not honour
# "!**/*.go" alone because the parent directories are still excluded.
# See https://github.com/containers/buildah/issues/6417
!cmd
!api
!internal

# Re-include Go source files, but not *_test.go
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum
